{"id": "transit-impact-fee-project-funding-deficit", "title": "An older San Francisco transit fee ended four fiscal years below zero", "seconds": 43.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "577bdb96b543c3fc", "words": 149, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco replaced most of an older transit fee in 2015.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.42, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "happened", "to", "the", "older", "transit", "account?"], "sub": "A successor fee narrowed future income to the older account", "source": "rules"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.79, 1.16, 1.4, 1.49, 1.58, 1.84, 2.17, 2.34, 2.43, 2.67]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The older fee still had a balance and some development could still owe it.", "t0": 3.54, "t1": 6.49, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rules", "kicker": "A successor fee narrowed future income to the older account", "text": "Two separate transit fees", "mark": "Two"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.38, 0.58, 0.79, 0.89, 0.95, 1.43, 1.65, 1.85, 2.32, 2.46, 2.67, 2.84]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Central Subway received more than sixteen million dollars from that account.", "t0": 6.71, "t1": 10.16, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "projects", "layout": "table", "heading": "Older fee project funding", "context": "Two positive entries", "rows": [{"label": "Central Subway", "value": "$16,072,066"}, {"label": "Group of transit projects", "value": "$11,591,342"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.46, 0.94, 1.3, 1.45, 1.64, 2.12, 2.42, 2.72, 2.86, 3.01]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Another group of transit projects drew funding the following year. The account turned negative.", "t0": 10.28, "t1": 14.74, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fund", "kicker": "Two years of project funding exceeded the remaining resources", "text": "A negative $1,893,156 balance", "mark": "A"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.57, 0.66, 1.01, 1.52, 1.74, 2.09, 2.2, 2.57, 3.25, 3.41, 3.73, 3.95]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City later reversed $742,858 that it had overallocated to a transit project.", "t0": 14.86, "t1": 21.4, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "projects", "kicker": "A negative project journal changes how the expenditure total reads", "text": "A negative $742,858 project journal", "mark": "A"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.63, 1.09, 1.4, 1.71, 2.19, 2.67, 2.93, 3.23, 3.77, 4.18, 4.34, 4.43, 4.6, 5.41, 5.55, 5.62, 5.98]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The published total adds the positive lines. Including the reversal gives a smaller net figure.", "t0": 21.52, "t1": 26.31, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "projects", "layout": "table", "heading": "Which project total?", "context": "Table J1.3", "rows": [{"label": "Printed positive total", "value": "$27,663,408"}, {"label": "Negative project row", "value": "−$742,858"}, {"label": "Signed total", "value": "$26,920,550"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.43, 0.79, 1.07, 1.17, 1.58, 2.37, 2.86, 2.98, 3.52, 3.74, 3.82, 4.17, 4.35]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The fund closed below zero for four fiscal years in a row.", "t0": 26.53, "t1": 29.23, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fund", "kicker": "Four consecutive fiscal years closed below zero", "text": "Four year-end balances below zero", "mark": "Four"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.37, 0.66, 0.94, 1.28, 1.44, 1.68, 2.03, 2.24, 2.32, 2.39]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "At the end of fiscal 2025, it was still more than a million dollars below zero.", "t0": 29.35, "t1": 33.32, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "fund", "layout": "table", "heading": "Negative ending balances", "context": "Older Transit Impact Development Fee", "rows": [{"label": "FY2023–24", "value": "−$1,162,786"}, {"label": "FY2024–25", "value": "−$1,159,162"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.21, 0.35, 0.45, 0.8, 1.04, 1.78, 1.91, 2.02, 2.26, 2.45, 2.6, 2.67, 2.97, 3.28, 3.56]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Controller attributed that balance to funding projects beyond the revenue received.", "t0": 33.44, "t1": 37.26, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fund", "kicker": "Four consecutive fiscal years closed below zero", "text": "The Controller’s explanation", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.55, 1.01, 1.2, 1.58, 1.7, 2.02, 2.46, 2.78, 2.89, 3.25]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The next year’s closing ledger would show which funds covered the gap.", "t0": 37.38, "t1": 40.45, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fund", "kicker": "Four consecutive fiscal years closed below zero", "text": "The outstanding closeout", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.34, 0.58, 0.96, 1.31, 1.51, 1.75, 2.0, 2.34, 2.61, 2.72]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 40.57, "t1": 42.72, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "A successor fee narrowed future income to the older account", "b": "Two years of project funding exceeded the remaining resources", "o": "Four consecutive fiscal years closed below zero"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "person"}